    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MINDBRINGERS is an action-adventure experience that mixes fast-paced, flashy, strategic combat with a wide variety of puzzles and gripping dialog.<br><br>Fight and explore through the astral planes in this epic grand adventure where corruption and idealism will clash once and for all.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MINDBRINGERS are astral special forces working directly under the orders of The King, tasked with missions of assassination, espionage, and intelligence gathering.\u00a0<br><br>Play as ALLURE, the newest and least experienced MINDBRINGER who's just starting to learn the tricks of her trade. Follow her as she fights those who need to be subdued and solves the puzzles of their minds.\u00a0<br> </p>",
